{"id":"en_the-fallen-lord-s-three-fierce-brides","title":"The Fallen Lord's Three Fierce Brides","titleEn":"The Fallen Lord's Three Fierce Brides","description":"After losing his memory, he lived for three years beside a street stall, enduring humiliation from the woman he called his girlfriend. Everything changes when three formidable seniors arrive: a governor, a CEO, and a superstar. They help him recover what he has forgotten, and with his memory restored, he takes revenge on the one who betrayed him. Yet the return of this godlike figure to power brings a new dilemma, as the three fierce women each lay claim to his heart, leaving open the question of whether he can ever settle on only one.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-fallen-lords-three-fierce-brides/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-fallen-lords-three-fierce-brides/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Feel-Good","Karma Payback","Urban Fantasy","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl916/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-fallen-lord-s-three-fierce-brides_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl916/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fallen-lord-s-three-fierce-brides_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl916/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fallen-lord-s-three-fierce-brides_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dl916/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-fallen-lord-s-three-fierce-brides_4","title":"Episode